WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:10.420
How did rivals end up signing one page? Semafor traced the idea back five days.

2
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:21.749
On September 24, at the state dinner for China's President Xi, Mark Zuckerberg talked with House Speaker Mike Johnson about his concerns over SI regulation.

3
00:00:21.749 --> 00:00:25.400
Zuckerberg then brought in Nvidia's Jensen Huang, to help

4
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.820
develop principles the industry could present to the President.

5
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:37.060
Zuckerberg circulated a draft. Huang helped gather support from OpenAI, Anthropic, xAI and others.

6
00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:40.880
On Tuesday, the President released it as the White House Accord

7
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.660
on Super Intelligence.

8
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:49.780
Semafor's account comes from three people familiar with the matter. Meta and the White House declined to comment.

9
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.660
Zuckerberg's own summary, to reporters: “This is a start.”
